Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:33.98,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,470)}Sankt Jeder, Giad Federacy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.89,0:01:37.52,Italics Top,News,0,0,0,,The Festival of the Holy Birth is next week, \Nand the whole city's getting ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.70,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,December 18th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:40.73,Italics,News,0,0,0,,Today we'll show you just \Nhow much fun everyone's having!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:46.57,Italics,News,0,0,0,,This is a special ornament set \Nyou can get only at this market.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.57,0:01:49.01,Italics,News,0,0,0,,It's so cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.01,0:01:50.83,Italics,Boyfriend TV,0,0,0,,It's kind of expensive!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:54.06,Italics,Girlfriend TV,0,0,0,,I want it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:57.56,Italics,Boyfriend TV,0,0,0,,Oh, fine! I'll take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:58.86,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:59.23,Italics Top,Woman TV,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.21,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Theresa, where's Shinei?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:03.68,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.11,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.11,0:02:06.81,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,You're really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.17,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,You loaded that fridge \Nall by yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.93,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Oh, that's easy, \Nif you know the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.36,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.98,Main,Truck man 2,0,0,0,,But that delivery to the seventh floor \Nwith no elevator yesterday was really rough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:20.61,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,It was a three-ring circus \Nfilled with fun and excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:22.25,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.62,0:02:27.93,Main,Woman 1,0,0,0,,Want to go to that café?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.93,0:02:28.87,Main,Woman 2,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.07,0:02:30.81,Main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,Where are we going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.49,Main,Boyfriend,0,0,0,,Hmm... Maybe try on some clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:34.21,Main,Girlfriend,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.69,Main,Glasses Man,0,0,0,,You've got a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.73,0:03:01.18,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.07,0:03:03.82,sign_4366_29_Cooking_Class,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Cooking Class
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:10.96,Main,Cook woman 1,0,0,0,,Hey, you only ever learned \Nto make desserts, right, Anju?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:14.35,Main,Cook woman 2,0,0,0,,You'll want to learn to do normal cooking, \Nor you'll have problems in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.35,0:03:15.50,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Future?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:18.32,Main,Cook woman 2,0,0,0,,When you cook for your kids, \Nfor example.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.94,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Kids? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:23.76,sign_4838_35_Imperial_Capital,Onscreen,0,0,0,,Imperial Capital Central Library
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:25.99,Main,Library woman 1,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:27.85,Main,Library woman 1,0,0,0,,He's always so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.80,Main,Library women,0,0,0,,Hi, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:08.40,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:15.71,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Nina, when someone does something for you\Nor lets you have something, say "thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:18.76,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Sorry, my sister was very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:22.80,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. \NI wasn't reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.24,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,It's not fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:27.08,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You need to have them learn \Nat a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.64,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:32.30,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.85,0:04:35.44,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:38.97,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Oh jeez... that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.17,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:43.87,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Sorry to get you involved in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:46.76,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,No, it must be rough \Nbeing a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:50.91,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I don't know where she got it from, \Nbut she's really shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:56.24,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Um... This may be rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:58.06,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,but you're here a lot \Nat this time of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.94,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Don't you have school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.94,0:05:00.99,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:05.93,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,If you see me a lot, \Nthat means you're here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:07.79,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.58,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I don't go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:11.03,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:13.76,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,We're not that wealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:17.03,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Sorry for just talking \Nto you out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.03,0:05:18.71,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I'm Eugene Rantz.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.17,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:22.05,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Shinei Nouzen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Frederica Rosenfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.43,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Nina Rantz.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.90,0:05:27.45,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:30.35,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I read her a book, \Nand she took a liking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:35.36,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It was a story for little kids, \Nwith lots of princes and princesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:37.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'll read the rest some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:37.92,Main,Nina,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:38.94,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.86,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.83,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.83,0:05:42.86,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shinei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:46.65,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're not doing anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:48.31,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:07.04,Main,Booth Man,0,0,0,,It's a little early, but why not get it \Nfor her as a festival present?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:10.23,Main,Booth Man,0,0,0,,I'll give you a discount, \Nsince your little sister's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:11.44,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.06,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:17.57,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:23.03,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I... I... want it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:32.42,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're more gullible than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:35.11,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Where did you learn\N how to do that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:17.52,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,I want to go home early tomorrow, \Nso I'll stay a little later tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.70,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It's the Eve of the Holy Birth tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:24.12,Main,Secretary,0,0,0,,The Republic has a tradition \Nof exchanging presents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:25.95,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Presents, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:28.42,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,What would be good, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:32.52,Main,Suit,0,0,0,,They've been here a month,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:35.77,Main,Suit,0,0,0,,and they've all found friends \Nand things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:38.14,Main,Suit,0,0,0,,They're fitting in well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.14,0:07:41.81,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a good sign \Nthat they've made friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:44.42,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:49.58,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,We're going to have to find a real path \Nfor them to take in life, once spring comes around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.72,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I know it's an awful thing to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:10.10,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,You've gone as far as you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.34,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,You've taken us with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:18.62,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So you should be able to forget about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.09,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,But knowing that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:24.99,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,It still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.75,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Staying here hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:31.87,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm dead. I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.40,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,So... Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:37.67,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Our Reaper...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:45.71,Main,Kaie,0,0,0,,Please, save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.17,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:09:02.22,Main Top,Eugene,0,0,0,,I know the sunlight's nice and warm, \Nbut the librarians will get mad at you for sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:03.60,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,473)}December 24th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.66,Main Top,Eugene,0,0,0,,Did you stay up too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:06.06,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:09.78,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,It's about time. \NWant to go see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:10.91,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.91,0:09:13.91,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,The military's Holy Birth Festival Eve Parade!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.88,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,This year it's the Western Theater's \N24th Mechanized Infantry Division,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:21.90,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,so we should be able to see the latest\N model of third-generation Vánagandrs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.52,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Oh, are you not interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:29.70,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,No, you just don't seem like\N somebody who would care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.34,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I'm joining the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:35.01,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I volunteered for the Mechanized Infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.67,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,So I wanted to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:41.21,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I thought you were the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:45.74,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,You were looking at military documents \Nyesterday and the day before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.13,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,I thought you were trying to get \Ninto the Special Officer's School, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:54.53,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,This place is peaceful, \Nbut they're fighting at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:57.53,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,And we don't know \Nwhen the war will come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.60,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,If there's something I can do \Nto prevent that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:04.07,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,to protect my little sister \Nand this town, I want to do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.69,0:10:08.45,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,And someday, I want my sister \Nto see the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:12.48,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,So I need this war to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:14.74,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.32,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll be off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.86,Main,Eugene,0,0,0,,Come if you're curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:28.97,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,I've rested too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:39.24,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,December 24th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:10:57.70,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:01.49,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,You said you were going \Nto Republic Plaza,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:03.41,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,so I thought you might be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.37,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:07.24,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I want your help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:10.72,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I need to carry some things, \Nand I can't do it all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.72,0:11:13.52,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Sure, sure. Need anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:15.01,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Shin's probably free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:16.04,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Shin—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:24.33,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,These things sure are "convenient," \Naren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:26.86,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Even though you have \Nto carry them around everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:29.80,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,and they don't work \Nif the other person turns them off,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:33.68,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,and you have to punch in the number \Neach time or register it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:35.93,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,You preferred the implants?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:42.63,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,It's weird how the Federacy \Nwanted those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.93,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I know it's odd to say this \Nafter we used them for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:47.24,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,but we know basically nothing about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:49.94,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Well, they're probably useful \Non the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.88,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,These things get jammed easily, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:54.64,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,As for the Juggernauts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.48,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I don't know what they expect to learn \Nfrom looking at those walking coffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:02.26,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,There wasn't anything I wanted \Nto take from them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.27,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:05.20,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,He's not answering!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:11.96,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,You know... Shin wanted \Nhis scarf and pistol back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:16.45,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Ernst ended up holding on to the pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:20.06,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,It's the pistol he used to end everyone's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.35,0:12:25.08,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Shin never let anyone else do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:30.83,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I'm sure he had to, \Nbecause of the voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:34.28,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,but I don't think it would kill him \Nto take it easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:38.85,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,There were probably times when\N being trapped by it helped him survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:44.49,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,In a way, it kept him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.49,0:12:50.21,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Maybe having the goal of killing his brother \Nkept him here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:54.39,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Without that, now he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:05.64,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,This place, Republic Plaza, \Nis where the Republic's embassy was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.64,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I didn't know that when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:11.02,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm still trapped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.21,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,What about you, Anju?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:19.69,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,You were supposed to die on that \Nbattlefield, but you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.41,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,They want us to think about our futures.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:25.11,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Have you decided on yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:31.78,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I thought about it a lot, \Nbut it's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.28,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,The things I think \NI should be doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.24,0:13:38.92,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,You're asking me now? \NIsn't it too late for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.10,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.66,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:47.80,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:50.10,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Come on, Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:05.13,Main,Truck man 2,0,0,0,,Wow! The Vánagandrs are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:07.06,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,How do you drive one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.95,Main,Truck man 1,0,0,0,,I'd love to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:15.25,Main,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.25,0:14:17.63,Main,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'd look great in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:22.68,Main,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,If you wait till next week, \Nit'll be 20% off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.46,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.46,0:14:25.39,Main,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,Yup, yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.35,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I don't really know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.77,Main,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,Come back if you change your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:33.64,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.24,Main Top,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,Come in! \NHey, I haven't seen you in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.76,Main Top,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,What are you looking for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.76,0:14:41.23,Main Top,Shop Woman,0,0,0,,Want to try on some of our new stuff? \NYou'll love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:47.98,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:51.58,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Raiden, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:54.24,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Where's Theresa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:57.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,She went shopping \Nand hasn't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.05,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Nobody's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:14:59.79,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:03.87,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm really hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.73,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:08.86,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.02,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.69,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You have my gratitude, Raiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:15.06,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.69,0:15:20.69,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Weren't you going drinking \Nwith your work buddies today?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.68,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:24.13,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.64,0:15:29.43,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You're lucky I was the one \Nwho came home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.43,0:15:33.19,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,If it were Shin, things would have\N turned out quite differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.19,0:15:36.16,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,What... so Shinei is a bad cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:40.65,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Not bad, but he doesn't care, \Nand it shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:42.23,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He only cares about fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.01,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:49.00,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Sounds like a man who dedicated \Neverything to killing his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:52.88,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,How did you know about Shin's brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:56.17,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.63,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Eat your carrots, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:01.36,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,How did you get in here \Nwithout making any noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:01.93,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:02.83,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,"Habit"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:05.13,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,What's all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.83,0:16:05.13,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,Stop it! It scares me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:07.00,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Just get used to it, \Nand it won't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:08.93,Main Top,A,0,0,0,,We went shopping with Theresa, \Nand the car broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:11.11,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,And since there was a lot to carry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:12.55,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,We looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.12,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,We called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.98,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:20.85,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:22.41,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,I wasn't doing anything anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:24.52,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,You should've just asked \Nfrom the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:28.25,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,I'm a servant here. I can't let \Nthe master's children carry my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:32.08,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,No, he's not our dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.08,0:16:35.34,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome home, Kurena.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:36.69,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:40.27,Main,A,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:43.17,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.99,0:16:57.56,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,I... think I've seen \Neverything I need to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.83,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,You've had enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.28,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.80,0:17:08.51,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Let's go back... \Nto where we belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:16.71,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.59,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,"Why?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:21.48,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,We're sorry for being suspicious at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.18,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,This is a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:26.31,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,So we stayed here a little too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.31,0:17:28.74,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,We've had our rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:30.76,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,And want to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:32.18,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,So we're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:35.80,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,But why go back to the battlefield?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.80,0:17:39.36,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,We said we wanted to from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:41.65,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:44.51,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,We were lucky, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:47.48,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,If we use that as an excuse \Nto stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:50.35,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,what can we say to those \Nwho died fighting until the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.92,0:17:54.67,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,We can't pretend \Nto be at peace when we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:58.77,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Even if we're going to die either way, \Nwe can choose how.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.42,0:18:02.21,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,If we're going to die someday, \Nwe will fight till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:04.16,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,That's the life we chose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.57,0:18:07.28,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Please don't take that from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:08.66,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.66,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:14.57,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,You made it here {\i1}because{\i0}\N you fought to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:17.38,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,You have the right \Nto enjoy your reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:21.01,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,That's what your comrades would want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:23.01,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,It's not something to be ashamed of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Silence, Ernst.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:28.95,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,They've finally escaped \Na cage of oppression.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:32.16,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Now you're going to trap them \Nin a cage of pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:37.88,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You're not so stupid to miss \Nthat you'd be the same as the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:44.07,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,They're not young, ignorant children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:48.06,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If they want to go, let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:54.09,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,And it wouldn't do to say you're going on ahead, \Nonly to have someone else go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.76,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.28,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,But on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:05.82,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,You need to go through the Special Officer's \NTraining School and become officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.82,0:19:07.63,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Otherwise, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.85,0:19:12.41,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,When you leave the service, officers will have \Nmore opportunities than enlisted soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:16.38,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,I want you to have as many choices available\N to you as possible when this war is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.69,0:19:18.82,Main,Theresa,0,0,0,,"When the war is over"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:21.09,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I never thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:23.29,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,This war will end someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:25.20,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,If you want to fight until the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.20,0:19:28.33,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,you need to think about \Nwhat'll happen when it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:34.10,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,You should be able to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:40.36,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I understand that you've got nothing \Nbut your pride to keep you together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:44.97,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,But that's no way for a \Ncomplete human being to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:50.51,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,It's blood and soil that \Nmake a person who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:55.20,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If you have neither, and try to define yourself \Njust by who you personally are,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:58.39,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,when you lose sight of that, \Nyou'll quickly fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:01.12,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Never forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.21,0:20:05.44,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.55,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm not a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:14.48,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,My true name is Augusta Frederica Adel-Adler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:18.14,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,The last Empress of the Empire of Giad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.14,0:20:25.32,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,who ordered the Legion to invade\N the rest of the continent ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:31.33,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I am one of those who took your families \Nand your home from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:34.04,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,If there's anything you want \Nto say to me, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:41.52,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're\N the last empress or whatever,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:44.92,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,but it was the Republic \Nwho took everything from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:48.34,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,We're not going \Nto suddenly forget that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.63,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't insult us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:53.69,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Also, how old were you ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:57.52,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.57,0:21:04.94,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,I admire your pride, \Nso let me make a request of you Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:05.99,Dates,Onscreen,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,473)}January 7th, Stellar Year 2149
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.25,0:21:07.10,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,If you're going back to the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:09.42,Main Top,Frederica,0,0,0,,take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:14.46,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,And help me destroy my knight's ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:16.71,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,He was taken by the Legion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:22.29,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Yes. The Legion who attacked you \Njust before you reached this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.47,Main,Shinei,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.67,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,The power of the blood \NI inherited allows me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.05,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,to see glimpses of the present \Nand past of those I meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:39.62,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,The wound your brother gave\N you hurt, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:43.33,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:46.18,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,But seeing is all I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.58,0:21:50.03,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,I can't save Kiriya alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:53.00,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,So please... help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:57.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Like the brother you saved, \Nand who saved you in turn...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:22:00.26,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Save my knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:25.19,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,Shin, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.03,Main,Ernst,0,0,0,,Have a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.48,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:37.73,Main,Frederica,0,0,0,,"Glad to be here."
